  "question": {
    "text": "A wooden wedge of mass <math><mi>M</mi></math> and inclination angle <math><mi>α</mi></math> rests on a smooth floor. A block of mass <math><mi>m</mi></math> is kept on wedge. A force <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">P</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math> is applied on the wedge as shown in figure, such that a block remains stationary with respect to wedge. The magnitude of force <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">P</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math> is<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/WhatsApp_Image_2020-08-12_at_2.03.48_PM.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 100px; height: 57px;\" />",
