  "solution": {
    "text": "Since, <math><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>)</mo><mi>a</mi></math><br /><br />Now as in free body diagram of block,<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/9_que_CA.JPG\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 167px;\" /><br /><br /><math><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mi>&nbsp;</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow></mrow></math> or <math><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow></mrow></math>",
